#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:10
#. Tag: date
#, no-c-format
msgid "2003-03-08"
msgstr "२००३-०३-०८"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:15
#. Tag: manvolnum
#, no-c-format
msgid "<manvolnum>1</manvolnum>"
msgstr "<मन्वोल्नुम्>१</मन्वोल्नुम्>"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:20
#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Creates <filename>Makefile.in</filename> and <filename>Makefile</filename> "
"from a <filename>Makefile.am</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>Makefile.in</filename> तथा <filename>Makefile</filename> इत्येतत् "
"<filename>Makefile.am</filename> इत्यस्मात् निर्माति"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:24
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>create_makefile</command> "
"<group><replaceable>relativepath/Makefile</replaceable></group> "
"<group><replaceable>relativepath</replaceable></group>"
msgstr ""
"<command>create_makefile</command> "
"<group><replaceable>relativepath/Makefile</replaceable></group> "
"<समूह><प्रतिस्थापनीय>सापेक्षमार्ग</replaceable></group>"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:32
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "वर्णनम्‌"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:34
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>create_makefile</command> creates the "
"<filename>Makefile.in</filename> and <filename>Makefile</filename> in a "
"subdirectory containing a <filename>Makefile.am</filename>. This script "
"saves time compared to re-running configure completely"
msgstr ""
"<command>create_makefile</command> <filename>Makefile.am</filename> इति "
"उपनिर्देशिकायां <filename>Makefile.in</filename> तथा "
"<filename>Makefile</filename> इत्येतत् निर्माति । एषा स्क्रिप्ट् पूर्णतया "
"विन्यासस्य पुनः चालनस्य तुलने समयस्य रक्षणं करोति"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:39
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that you must supply the path to the desired "
"<filename>Makefile</filename> <filename>Makefile.am</filename> (though the "
"final <filename>/Makefile</filename> may be omitted)."
msgstr ""
"ध्यानं कुर्वन्तु यत् भवद्भिः इष्टस्य <filename>Makefile</filename> "
"<filename>Makefile.am</filename> इत्यस्य मार्गस्य आपूर्तिः करणीयः (यद्यपि "
"अन्तिमः <filename>/Makefile</filename> लोपः भवितुम् अर्हति) ।"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:43
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This script may be run from the toplevel directory (the one containing "
"<filename>configure</filename>) or from one of it's subdirectories."
msgstr ""
"इयं स्क्रिप्ट् toplevel निर्देशिकातः (<filename>configure</filename> इति "
"युक्तात्) अथवा अस्य उपनिर्देशिकाभ्यः एकस्मात् चालयितुं शक्यते ।"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:47
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the source directory is different from the build directory (see the "
"environment variables below), it will be assumed that the "
"<filename>Makefile.am</filename> and <filename>Makefile.in</filename> "
"belong beneath the source directory and that the "
"<filename>Makefile</filename> belongs beneath the build directory."
msgstr ""
"यदि स्रोतनिर्देशिका निर्माणनिर्देशिकातः भिन्ना अस्ति (अधः वातावरणचराः "
"पश्यन्तु), तर्हि <filename>Makefile.am</filename> तथा "
"<filename>Makefile.in</filename> स्रोतनिर्देशिकायाः अधः सन्ति इति कल्प्यते "
"तथा च <filename>Makefile</filename> इति निर्माणनिर्देशिकायाः अधः अस्ति इति ।"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:54
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "This utility is part of the &kde; Software Development Kit."
msgstr "एषा उपयोगिता &kde; सॉफ्टवेयर विकास किट।"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:59
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "पर्यावरणम्‌"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:61
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One of the following variables (but not both) should be set if the source "
"directory is different from the build directory. If the build directory is "
"simply a subdirectory of the source directory, the simpler variable "
"<envar>OBJ_SUBDIR</envar> should be used."
msgstr ""
"यदि स्रोतनिर्देशिका build निर्देशिकातः भिन्ना अस्ति तर्हि निम्नलिखितचरानाम् "
"एकः (किन्तु उभयत्र न) सेट् कर्तव्यः । यदि build निर्देशिका केवलं "
"स्रोतनिर्देशिकायाः उपनिर्देशिका अस्ति तर्हि सरलतरं चरं "
"<envar>OBJ_SUBDIR</envar> उपयोक्तव्यम् ।"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:68
#. Tag: envar
#, no-c-format
msgid "OBJ_SUBJDIR"
msgstr "OBJ_SUBJDIR"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:69
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Indicates that the build directory is in the given subdirectory of the "
"source directory. For instance, if the source directory is <filename "
"class=\"directory\">kdesdk</filename> and the build directory is <filename "
"class=\"directory\">kdesdk/obj-i386-linux</filename>, then "
"<envar>OBJ_SUBDIR</envar> should be set to "
"<parameter>obj-i386-linux</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"build directory स्रोतनिर्देशिकायाः दत्ते उपनिर्देशिकायां अस्ति इति सूचयति । "
"यथा, यदि स्रोतनिर्देशिका <filename class=\"directory\">kdesdk</filename> "
"अस्ति तथा च निर्माणनिर्देशिका <filename "
"class=\"directory\">kdesdk/obj-i386-linux</filename> अस्ति, तर्हि <envar> "
"OBJ_SUBDIR</envar> इत्येतत् <parameter>obj-i386-linux</parameter> इति सेट् "
"कर्तव्यम् ।"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:72
#. Tag: envar
#, no-c-format
msgid "OBJ_REPLACEMENT"
msgstr "OBJ_REPLACEMENT इति"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:73
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <command>sed</command> expression that is used to transform the source "
"directory into the build directory. For instance, if the source directory "
"is <filename class=\"directory\">~/src/kdesdk</filename> and the build "
"directory is <filename class=\"directory\">~/src/kdesdk-obj</filename>, "
"then <envar>OBJ_REPLACEMENT</envar> should be set to "
"<parameter>s#kdesdk#kdesdk-obj#</parameter>."
msgstr ""
"एकं <command>sed</command> व्यञ्जनं यत् स्रोतनिर्देशिकायाः "
"निर्माणनिर्देशिकायां परिवर्तनार्थं उपयुज्यते । यथा, यदि स्रोतनिर्देशिका "
"<filename class=\"directory\">~/src/kdesdk</filename> अस्ति तथा च "
"निर्माणनिर्देशिका <filename class=\"directory\">~/src/kdesdk-obj</filename> "
"अस्ति, तर्हि ततः <envar>OBJ_REPLACEMENT</envar> इत्येतत् "
"<parameter>s#kdesdk#kdesdk-obj#</parameter> इति सेट् कर्तव्यम् ।"

#: man-create_makefile.1.docbook:80
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "See Also"
msgstr "इदमपि पश्यन्तु"

